    {
      "subId": "7080006",
      "subQuestName": "与艾伦对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708000601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708000601": {
            "id": "708000601",
            "speakerId": 1539,
            "speakerName": "艾伦",
            "text": "得，得救了…真是太谢谢了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708000602"
            ]
          },
          "708000602": {
            "id": "708000602",
            "speakerId": 1539,
            "speakerName": "艾伦",
            "text": "真没想到，就是猎个林猪也能这么麻烦…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708000603"
            ]
          },
          "708000603": {
            "id": "708000603",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "关于布洛克要的食材…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708000604"
            ]
          },
          "708000604": {
            "id": "708000604",
            "speakerId": 1539,
            "speakerName": "艾伦",
            "text": "是布洛克让你来的？啊…其实她要的新鲜兽肉，我已经弄到了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708000605"
            ]
          },
          "708000605": {
            "id": "708000605",
            "speakerId": 1539,
            "speakerName": "艾伦",
            "text": "不过我追林猪的时候太大意，一不小心就惊动了附近的魔物…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708000606"
            ]
          },
          "708000606": {
            "id": "708000606",
            "speakerId": 1539,
            "speakerName": "艾伦",
            "text": "虽然林猪是猎到了，但我也被魔物们给围住了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708000607"
            ]
          },
          "708000607": {
            "id": "708000607",
            "speakerId": 1539,
            "speakerName": "艾伦",
            "text": "旅行者，能拜托你把这些肉送给布洛克吗，我要先去城里，拜托教会那边治疗一下我的伤…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708000608"
            ]
          },
          "708000608": {
            "id": "708000608",
            "speakerId": 1539,
            "speakerName": "艾伦",
            "text": "唉，又搞成这个样子，杜拉夫先生肯定又要说我了…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7080007",
      "subQuestName": "回到清泉镇与布洛克对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708000701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708000701": {
            "id": "708000701",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "啊，你们来了吗，兽肉准备的怎么样了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708000702"
            ]
          },
          "708000702": {
            "id": "708000702",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "已经带来了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708000703"
            ]
          },
          "708000703": {
            "id": "708000703",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "嗯，我来看看…确实很新鲜，这样应该就可以了。主料就用这些兽肉，再准备一点有「风的味道」的辅料就好…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708000704"
            ]
          },
          "708000704": {
            "id": "708000704",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "唔，说到带有「风的味道」的辅料…那当然就是「蒲公英籽」了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708000705"
            ]
          },
          "708000705": {
            "id": "708000705",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "旅行者，你能帮我去收集一点蒲公英籽吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708000706"
            ]
          },
          "708000706": {
            "id": "708000706",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "交给我吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708000707"
            ]
          },
          "708000707": {
            "id": "708000707",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "那就麻烦你了，我先去处理一下兽肉，搜集好蒲公英籽之后，就直接拿来给我吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7080008",
      "subQuestName": "将一份蒲公英籽交给布洛克",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708000801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708000801": {
            "id": "708000801",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "你准备好蒲公英籽了吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7080009",
      "subQuestName": "与布洛克对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708000901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708000901": {
            "id": "708000901",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "谢谢，这下材料就都准备好了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708000902"
            ]
          },
          "708000902": {
            "id": "708000902",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "辛苦你了，这些东西请你收下吧，就算是报酬了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708000903"
            ]
          },
          "708000903": {
            "id": "708000903",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "不过要怎么处理，才能让整道菜都带上「风的味道」呢？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708000904"
            ]
          },
          "708000904": {
            "id": "708000904",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "蒸煮煎炸…唔…不然，还是以食材的原味为主，在整道菜出锅之后再把蒲公英籽撒上去吧…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7080010",
      "subQuestName": "与布洛克对话$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708001001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708001001": {
            "id": "708001001",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "怎么了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001002"
            ]
          },
          "708001002": {
            "id": "708001002",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "你是…我记得你，你是香菱的那位助手，对吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001003"
            ]
          },
          "708001003": {
            "id": "708001003",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "上次的对决真是让人印象深刻，我现在还记忆犹新呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001004"
            ]
          },
          "708001004": {
            "id": "708001004",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "虽然上次我输给了香菱，但这一次，我决定要研究出一道带有「风的味道」的菜。然后，用这道菜再和香菱一决胜负！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001005"
            ]
          },
          "708001005": {
            "id": "708001005",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "为了这道菜，我还特地去拜托了一位冒险家，帮我去雪山里取一些「冷鲜肉」回来。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001006"
            ]
          },
          "708001006": {
            "id": "708001006",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "但那位叫做舒特的冒险家，到现在还没有回来…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001007"
            ]
          },
          "708001007": {
            "id": "708001007",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "我听说雪山里十分危险，那位冒险家不会是遇到什么危险了吧…你能帮我去找找他吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001008"
            ]
          },
          "708001008": {
            "id": "708001008",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "没问题。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001009"
            ]
          },
          "708001009": {
            "id": "708001009",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "你愿意帮忙那真是太好了，雪山的气候严寒，记得随时生火取暖啊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7080011",
      "subQuestName": "前往雪山寻找舒特",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708001101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708001101": {
            "id": "708001101",
            "speakerId": 157301,
            "speakerName": "害怕的舒特",
            "text": "冷，冷…怎么这么冷…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001102"
            ]
          },
          "708001102": {
            "id": "708001102",
            "speakerId": 157301,
            "speakerName": "害怕的舒特",
            "text": "谁，谁…谁能帮忙生一下火吗…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7080012",
      "subQuestName": "点燃火堆",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7080013",
      "subQuestName": "与害怕的舒特对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708001301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708001301": {
            "id": "708001301",
            "speakerId": 157301,
            "speakerName": "害怕的舒特",
            "text": "活，活过来了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001302"
            ]
          },
          "708001302": {
            "id": "708001302",
            "speakerId": 157301,
            "speakerName": "害怕的舒特",
            "text": "是你生的火吗…好心的旅行者…谢谢你，多谢你了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001303"
            ]
          },
          "708001303": {
            "id": "708001303",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你还好吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001304"
            ]
          },
          "708001304": {
            "id": "708001304",
            "speakerId": 157301,
            "speakerName": "害怕的舒特",
            "text": "现在暖和点了，还好…还好…我本来是接到委托，进雪山取那种「冷鲜肉」…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001305"
            ]
          },
          "708001305": {
            "id": "708001305",
            "speakerId": 157301,
            "speakerName": "害怕的舒特",
            "text": "我最开始就是想在雪山外围找找看就好，但是走着走着不小心弄丢了火种，又不小心迷了路…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001306"
            ]
          },
          "708001306": {
            "id": "708001306",
            "speakerId": 157301,
            "speakerName": "害怕的舒特",
            "text": "要是没有你，我都不知道怎么办才好了，多谢你了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001307"
            ]
          },
          "708001307": {
            "id": "708001307",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "关于布洛克的委托…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001308"
            ]
          },
          "708001308": {
            "id": "708001308",
            "speakerId": 157301,
            "speakerName": "害怕的舒特",
            "text": "是布洛克拜托你找我的，唉…她肯定已经等急了。但我实在没体力把这份肉再大老远送回镇上了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001309"
            ]
          },
          "708001309": {
            "id": "708001309",
            "speakerId": 157301,
            "speakerName": "害怕的舒特",
            "text": "虽然很不好意思，但能请你帮我把这份「冷鲜肉」送过去吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001310"
            ]
          },
          "708001310": {
            "id": "708001310",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "交给我吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001311"
            ]
          },
          "708001311": {
            "id": "708001311",
            "speakerId": 157301,
            "speakerName": "害怕的舒特",
            "text": "多谢你了。我得回山下的营地去，好好喝口热汤…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7080014",
      "subQuestName": "与冒险家对话$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7080015",
      "subQuestName": "回到清泉镇与布洛克对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708001501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708001501": {
            "id": "708001501",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "你们回来了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001502"
            ]
          },
          "708001502": {
            "id": "708001502",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "肉已经带回来了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001503"
            ]
          },
          "708001503": {
            "id": "708001503",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "那太好了！欸？舒特呢…他没遇见危险吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001504"
            ]
          },
          "708001504": {
            "id": "708001504",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "他应该已经没事了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001505"
            ]
          },
          "708001505": {
            "id": "708001505",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "那就好，幸好没有出大事…等我把新菜做好了之后，也带过去给他尝尝吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001506"
            ]
          },
          "708001506": {
            "id": "708001506",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "话说回来，这「冷鲜肉」看着确实和普通肉类不一样，用这个做材料，说不定真能做出那种有「噼咔」感的菜…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001507"
            ]
          },
          "708001507": {
            "id": "708001507",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "不过，要想让菜带有「风的味道」的话，还需要蒲公英籽来做辅料…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001508"
            ]
          },
          "708001508": {
            "id": "708001508",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "但如果只是这样的话，感觉跟普通的肉类菜品也没有很大区别，还少一种决定性的辅料。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001509"
            ]
          },
          "708001509": {
            "id": "708001509",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "对了，对了！在那场对决之后，其实我还见过几次香菱，还从她那里听到了一道叫做「史莱姆滑蘑菇」的菜。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001510"
            ]
          },
          "708001510": {
            "id": "708001510",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "这种新奇的材料，我还从来没用过…不过，想要做出新奇的菜，就要尝试新奇的材料。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001511"
            ]
          },
          "708001511": {
            "id": "708001511",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
            "text": "旅行者，那就拜托你帮我去找一份史莱姆凝液和一份蒲公英籽吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001512"
            ]
          },
          "708001512": {
            "id": "708001512",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "交给我吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708001513"
            ]
          },
          "708001513": {
            "id": "708001513",
            "speakerId": 1541,
            "speakerName": "布洛克",
